OL,3,GNEWSARare Chinese Qing dynasty vases
OL,4,Acould fetch #50,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of rare Chinese vases thought to
OL,7,Fdate back from the 17th Century are
OL,8,Festimated to fetch up to #50,000 when
OL,9,Fthey go under the hammer next week.
OL,11,FThe two Chinese Famille Verte 'Ladies'
OL,12,FVases are thought to date back to the
OL,13,FKangxi period of the Qing dynasty,
OL,14,Fbetween 1662 and 1722.
OL,16,FAuction house Mallam's explained that
OL,17,Fthe vases had been in an Oxfordshire
OL,18,Fcountry house and represented "an
OL,19,Fextraordinary rediscovery of Chinese
OL,20,Fporcelain".
