OL,3,GNEWSARare Chinese Qing dynasty vases
OL,4,Acould fetch #50,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe auctioneers, based in Cheltenham,
OL,7,Festimate the "magnificent and
OL,8,Fimportant" pair of vases could sell for
OL,9,Fbetween #30,000 and #50,000 when they
OL,10,Fgo up for sale on Wednesday.
